/* letterati-common.js
   Mystery Word candidate pool for Letterati.

   Source: OpenSubtitles 2018 English frequency list (hermitdave/FrequencyWords),
   licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Derived and redistributed under the same licence.

   ORDER IS SIGNIFICANT. The list runs from most to least frequently spoken, and
   the game reads a word's position as its rarity signal when tiering Mystery
   Words (Common / Uncommon / Rare / Cryptic). Re-sorting this file alphabetically
   would silently flatten that system, so the game checks for it at load and
   drops the signal rather than tiering everything wrong.

   Built 2026-08-31. 71,215 entries.
   Filters applied, in order:
     - 4 to 9 letters, lowercase a-z only
     - must appear in the game's dictionary sources (words_alpha + ENABLE)
     - family-safety stem blocklist (slurs, sexual content, drugs, violence)
     - ENABLE membership required, which removes proper nouns, transliterations,
       typos and foreign fragments (the frequency tail is otherwise dominated by
       names such as "vespucci" and "paraguay")
   Inflections are retained. Those whose only dictionary sense is a "plural of X"
   pointer are filtered at runtime by the clue check, which is cheap now that
   lookups resolve from a persistent cache in preference order.
*/
